1
00:00:00,079 --> 00:00:01,735
Ingen prat, bare resultater.

2
00:00:01,735 --> 00:00:03,079
Slik fungerer den.

3
00:00:03,079 --> 00:00:05,427
Ikke noe tull, bare sett i, slå på

4
00:00:05,427 --> 00:00:06,019
og kjør.

5
00:00:06,019 --> 00:00:07,492
Kniven blir skarp igjen på

6
00:00:07,492 --> 00:00:08,002
sekunder.

7
00:00:08,002 --> 00:00:09,539
Treoverflaten blir glatt.

8
00:00:09,539 --> 00:00:11,399
Metallet får en fin polering.

9
00:00:11,399 --> 00:00:12,562
Dette er grunnen til at folk

10
00:00:12,562 --> 00:00:13,139
elsker den.

11
00:00:13,139 --> 00:00:15,579
Enkel, kompakt, fungerer
